## Airborne Base and transports (rules/airborne.yaml, IDEA-42)

actor-abrn =
    .name = Airborne Base
    .description =
    Home of the paratroopers: three pads for heavy
    airborne transports, each flying out with
    40 paratroopers to drop anywhere on the map.
      Builds and reloads airborne transports
      Requires Airfield

actor-il76 =
    .name = Il-76MD Candid
    .description =
    Heavy airborne transport with 40 paratroopers aboard.
    Right-click the ground to drop them there; it flies
    home and takes on a new force (paid) in a minute.
      Tail turret: twin 23 mm guns against aircraft
      Built on the Airborne Base

